- *   op 15), 22/23 local HBM on/off, 24/25 global HBM on/off
+ *   op 15), 22/23 local HBM on/off, 24/25 global HBM on/off, 26 lit auth while the finger is on the
+ *   spot (reads: finger id bits, -1008 no match, -4 lifted, -error; EPERM after 5 failures until a
